  "title": "Moodlight",
  "slug": "moodlight",
  "summary": "A hands-on workshop building a Wi-Fi-controlled RGB light at FabLab Bayreuth.",
  "content": "<p>I helped organize Arduino Day 2023 at FabLab Bayreuth and led the Moodlight workshop.</p><h3>From soldering to control</h3><p>Participants soldered their own light and controlled its LED colour from a phone or computer. The microcontroller can join an existing Wi-Fi network or create its own network for connecting to the light.</p><p>The workshop combines practical electronics with a browser-accessible control interface. The accompanying source material is available in the FabLab Bayreuth repository.</p>",
